<title>UK: UK gilt auction -- full results.</title>
<headline>UK gilt auction -- full results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the Bank of England</p>
<p>ISSUER: H M Treasury</p>
<p>MATURITY: 2002</p>
<p>COUPON: 7.0 PCT</p>
<p>AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 6.94 PCT</p>
<p>BID AMOUNT/COVER: 4,583.9 MLN STG/COVER 3.03 TIMES</p>
<p>LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE: 100.08</p>
<p>PCT ALLOCATED AT LOWEST PRICE: 27 PCT</p>
<p>NOTES: There was no yield or price tail at the auction. A total of 1,374.9 million stg in competitive bids were allotted. Gilt-edged market makers received 120 million stg in non-competitive bids and others picked up 5.1 million stg in non-competitive bids.</p>
<p>That left a total of 1.5 billion stg bids allotted.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
